<view class="page">
  <view class="form-item">
    <view class="form-label">反馈类型</view>
    <view class="type-list">
      <text
        class="chip {{type === item ? 'active' : ''}}"
        wx:for="{{types}}"
        wx:key="*this"
        data-value="{{item}}"
        bindtap="onTypeTap"
      >{{item}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="form-item">
    <view class="form-label required">问题描述</view>
    <textarea
      class="form-textarea"
      value="{{content}}"
      maxlength="500"
      placeholder="请描述具体场景、操作步骤与期望结果"
      placeholder-class="placeholder"
      bindinput="onContentInput"
    />
    <view class="form-tip">{{content.length}}/500</view>
  </view>

  <view class="form-item">
    <view class="form-label">联系方式</view>
    <input
      class="form-input"
      value="{{contact}}"
      placeholder="选填，便于我们回访"
      placeholder-class="placeholder"
      bindinput="onContactInput"
    />
  </view>

  <view class="notice">
    涉及订单争议、违规内容举报，请优先通过订单争议流程或话题举报入口提交，便于平台留存处理记录。
  </view>

  <view class="footer-holder"></view>
  <view class="footer-bar">
    <view class="btn btn-primary {{submitting ? 'btn-disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="onSubmit">
      {{submitting ? '提交中…' : '提交反馈'}}
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
